
---

## ✅ `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Node modules
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
build/

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Runtime data
*.log

# Environment
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test

# Editor directories
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Optional cache folders
.cache/
.next/
out/
